  "originalText": "For the following exercises, decompose into partial fractions.\n\n31. \\(\\frac{-2 x+6}{x^{2}+3 x+2}\\)\n\n32. \\(\\frac{10 x+2}{4 x^{2}+4 x+1}\\)\n\n33. \\(\\frac{7 x+20}{x^{2}+10 x+25}\\)\\\n\n34. \\(\\frac{x-18}{x^{2}-12 x+36}\\)\n\n35. \\(\\frac{-x^{2}+36 x+70}{x^{3}-125}\\)\n\n36. \\(\\frac{-5 x^{2}+6 x-2}{x^{3}+27}\\)\n\n37. \\(\\frac{x^{3}-4 x^{2}+3 x+11}{\\left(x^{2}-2\\right)^{2}}\\)\n\n38. \\(\\frac{4 x^{4}-2 x^{3}+22 x^{2}-6 x+48}{x\\left(x^{2}+4\\right)^{2}}\\)\n\nThis page titled 11.4E: Partial Fractions (Exercises) was last modified on Thu, 26 Dec 2024 22:31:02 GMT and is shared under a CC BY  4.0  license and was authored, remixed, and/or curated by OpenStax via source content that was edited to the style and standards of the LibreTexts platform.",
